    "Line of Plauen: Heinrich the Ruthenian as founder of the most vigorous line; the epithet Reuss (documented from 1266), interpretations of the name (battle of Wahlstedt against the Mongols 1241, wars against Poland), Prussian campaign of 1246/47 under his father, the Teutonic knight; footnotes on epithets of other families.",
